5a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Lemma 6.1.1(iii) and Lemma 6.5.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"87; 99"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"107; 119"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 和 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>；自然数参数按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}\\)</span> 编码。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\">\\(h:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 为部分可计算函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{dom}h\\;\\left(C(h(\\sigma))\\le C(\\sigma)+c\\land K(h(\\sigma))\\le K(\\sigma)+c\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{dom}h\\;\\left(C(h(\\sigma))\\le C(\\sigma)+c\\land K(h(\\sigma))\\le K(\\sigma)+c\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将描述机器后接 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span>。前缀情形的新机器域是旧域的子集，仍前缀自由。书写全函数版本，这里在定义域上陈述同一论证的部分函数推广。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Lemma 6.1.1(iii) and Lemma 6.5.3；印刷页 87; 99，PDF 页 107; 119。本次逐项核对陈述；下文给出笔记内论证，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pair-coding","status":"resolved","id":"e039afac1517f3d7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pair-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[43-df-kolm]] 的 $C$ 和 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的 $K$；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。 $h:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*$ 为部分可计算函数。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[43-df-kolm]] 的 $C$ 和 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的 $K$；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。 $h:\\Sigm